{"id":"wb-8-725","name":"开远长虹桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开远长虹桥","text":"开远长虹桥（哈尼语：Keil Yei Caq Haoq Qaoq，彝文：ꈁꑷꍤꉻꐇ），位于云南省红河哈尼族彝族自治州开远市乐白道街道楷甸村田房以东南盘江上的一座石拱桥，位于旧326国道线上，于1961年建成，为国家一级保护桥梁暨全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E8%BF%9C%E9%95%BF%E8%99%B9%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":90777256,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90777256","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/73fbd2f9fdab47c5167c9a64.jpg","title":"Changhong_Bridge_in_Kaiyuan,_Yunnan_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Changhong_Bridge_in_Kaiyuan,_Yunnan_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/Changhong_Bridge_in_Kaiyuan%2C_Yunnan_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangmoon618","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​位于云南省红河州开远市北部南盘江上的长虹桥南侧，远处大桥为锁蒙高速南盘江特大桥。","width":320,"height":240}}